<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BF Goodrich cut by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BF Goodrich cut by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it cut B.F. Goodrich Co from its recommended list and rated the stock market perform on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-5/8 to 43-1/8.</p>
</text>
